    {
      "episode_number": 1,
      "title": "Rule Number Three",
      "start_node_id": "e1_n01",
      "default_ambient": "piano_melancholy",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "e1_n01",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "11:05 PM · Night 1 of your 30-day fake engagement. You're in the guest wing of Ethan's penthouse when he texts.",
          "style": "banner",
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n02"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n02",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "ethan",
          "text": "Ground rules for tomorrow's board dinner, Audrey. Rule 1: Hold my hand in front of my uncle. Rule 2: No arguing about Q3.",
          "timestamp_label": "11:05 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 650,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n03"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n03",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "player",
          "text": "And Rule 3? Let me guess: \"Don't fall in love with me\"? Very original, Cole.",
          "timestamp_label": "11:06 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 0,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n04"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n04",
          "type": "unsent_message",
          "sender_id": "ethan",
          "text": "Rule 3 is for ME, because I've failed it since sophomore year.",
          "unsent_placeholder": "This message was unsent",
          "reveal_ms": 2000,
          "typing_delay_ms": 800,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n05"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n05",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "ethan",
          "text": "Rule 3: Never take off the sapphire ring when press are around. Goodnight.",
          "timestamp_label": "11:07 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 700,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n06"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n06",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "player",
          "text": "Wait... sophomore year? Ethan, what did you just unsend?!",
          "timestamp_label": "11:08 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 0,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n07"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n07",
          "type": "voice_note",
          "sender_id": "ethan",
          "duration_sec": 8,
          "transcript": "[quiet sigh] Nothing. Sleep, Audrey. Just... check the engraving inside the ring before tomorrow.",
          "audio_asset": null,
          "typing_delay_ms": 900,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n08"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n08",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "You tilt the sapphire ring under the bedside lamp. Engraved in tiny script: \"Oct 14 · Library Roof.\" The exact night you thought he stood you up.",
          "style": "system_alert",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n09"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n09",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Your heart is racing. He's right across the penthouse hall.",
          "options": [
            {
              "option_id": "opt_text_back",
              "label": "Text him about October 14 right now",
              "cost_type": "free",
              "badge_text": null,
              "player_reply_text": "You kept the date from the library roof? You NEVER showed up that night, Ethan!",
              "next_node_id": "e1_n10a"
            },
            {
              "option_id": "opt_vip_knock",
              "label": "Walk across the hall and knock on his door",
              "cost_type": "vip_rewarded",
              "badge_text": "VIP · Face to Face",
              "player_reply_text": "Open your door, Ethan. You have 30 seconds to explain this engraving.",
              "next_node_id": "e1_n10b"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n10a",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "ethan",
          "text": "I WAS there, Audrey. Someone locked the roof stairwell—and told me you transferred to Paris.",
          "timestamp_label": "11:11 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 750,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n11"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n10b",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "ethan",
          "text": "I'm opening it. And Audrey? This engagement was never fake on my side.",
          "timestamp_label": "11:11 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 750,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n11"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n11",
          "type": "cliffhanger",
          "headline": "Six Years Of Misunderstanding.",
          "teaser_text": "Episode 2: Ethan opens his door holding a faded polaroid—and reveals who really tore you apart.",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "ambient": "heartbeat",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_episode_number": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "episode_number": 2,
      "title": "The Boardroom Sabotage",
      "start_node_id": "e2_n01",
      "default_ambient": "luxury_lounge",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "e2_n01",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "Next Evening · 8:00 PM. The Cole family gala. You and Ethan enter hand in hand—then your phone buzzes.",
          "style": "banner",
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n02"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n02",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "ethan",
          "text": "Don't look now, Audrey. My uncle just hired a private investigator to prove our engagement is a contract.",
          "timestamp_label": "8:01 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 650,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n03"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n03",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "player",
          "text": "He's the same uncle who told you I moved to Paris in college, isn't he?",
          "timestamp_label": "8:02 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 0,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n04"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n04",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "ethan",
          "text": "Yes. He wanted me to marry a senator's daughter instead. He's walking toward our table with a folder.",
          "timestamp_label": "8:02 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 700,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n05"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n05",
          "type": "unsent_message",
          "sender_id": "ethan",
          "text": "If he asks us to prove it's real, I'm going to kiss you.",
          "unsent_placeholder": "This message was unsent",
          "reveal_ms": 1900,
          "typing_delay_ms": 700,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n06"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n06",
          "type": "voice_note",
          "sender_id": "ethan",
          "duration_sec": 7,
          "transcript": "[leaning close] You don't have to stay in this crossfire, Audrey. Tell me if you want out.",
          "audio_asset": null,
          "typing_delay_ms": 850,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n07"
        },
